Subject: Cantor Public Procedure Machine Schema

Description: Canonical formation for a deterministic provider-neutral machine-schema layer over Cantor's public procedure-tool forms. It separates JSON syntax, Cantor semantics, and authority admission; no implementation or provider behavior is activated by formation alone.

